# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the asan / hip-asan test presets (LSAN_OPTIONS
# in CMakePresets.json). Scoped to vendor runtimes only: a leak whose stack
# reaches calaman or WarpWraps code is still reported.
#
# ROCm's HSA runtime frees its per-agent tables lazily and never at exit, so
# every process that touches a device leaks the same ~6KB (ROCm 7.2.4,
# gfx1200). The CUDA driver needs no entry today.
#
# Every line here is registered, with its evidence and re-verify trigger, in
# docs/sanitizers.md (S1). Add nothing that is not.
leak:libhsa-runtime64.so
leak:libamdhip64.so
